頭括號列選曹尚書，殿本正文「權擢以為選舉」，卷末考證引《太平御覽》在「以為」下多四字。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-wu052-bz-20","person_id":"1lt_fsk_qnh","title":"桂陽太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092-pei01-01","quote":"吳書曰：肅字偉恭，南陽人。少以才聞，善論議，臧否得中，甄奇錄異，薦述後進，題目品藻，曲有條貫，眾人以此服之。權擢以為〔選曹尚書〕，選舉號為得才。求出補吏，為桂陽太守，吏民悅服。徵為卿。會卒，知與不知，並痛惜焉。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092-pei01-01:m0004"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-bz-20:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092-pei01-01","start":78,"end":82,"surface":"桂陽太守","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092-pei01-01:m0004","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092","text":"權稱尊號，拜驃騎將軍，領冀州牧。是歳，都督西陵。代陸遜撫二境，頃以冀州在蜀分，解牧職。時權太子登駐武昌，愛人好善，與騭書曰：「夫賢人君子，所以興隆大化，佐理時務者也。受性暗蔽，不達道數，雖實區區欲盡心於明德，歸分於君子，至於遠近士人，先後之宜，猶或緬焉，未之能詳。《傳》曰：『愛之能勿勞乎？忠焉能勿誨乎？』斯其義也，豈非所望於君子哉！」騭於是條於時事業在荊州界者，諸葛瑾、陸遜、朱然、程普、潘浚，斐玄、夏侯承，衞旌，李肅、周條、石干十一人。甄別行狀，因上疏獎勸曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line